# Required only for the natural-language rule input (Task 2).
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key. `.env` is git-ignored.
#
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# This key is read server-side only — by the /api/parse-rule serverless function
# in production, and by the Vite dev middleware locally. It is never bundled
# into the browser. See ARCHITECTURE.md §7.
#
# On Vercel, set the same variable under Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional — override the model without editing code.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.1
